{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56111","headline":"步虚词 四 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"控辔适十方，旋憇玄景阿。\n仰观劫仞台，俯眄紫云罗。\n逍遥太上景，相与坐莲华。\n积学爲真人，恬然荣卫和。\n永享无期寿，万椿所奚足多。\n（同前卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}